    "appTitle": "About Libroware",
    "appP1":    "Libroware is a production-grade, full-stack library management system designed to digitalise and streamline every facet of institutional library operations — cataloguing, lending, reservations, fines, and analytics — under a single, cohesive interface accessible from the web, mobile, and desktop.",
